WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
Think you know everything about the force?

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.640
Here's 29 Star Wars facts you probably don't know. 

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.710
It's a trap!

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:09.660
Alec Guinness called the Star Wars films fairy tale rubbish. 

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.680
Despite this he earned 2% of the gross box office receipts for the original trilogy. 

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.100
Making him over 95 million dollars. 

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.510
In my experience there's no such thing as luck. 

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:22.810
Harrison Ford earned only 2,000 dollars a week for his role in episode 4. 

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.690
10,000 all in advance.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:30.050
Peter Cushing found his costume boots so uncomfortable he wore slippers during many of his scenes.  

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.200
And insisted his feet never be shown. 

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.030
The TIE fighter engine sound is an elephant call mixed with a car driving on wet pavement. 

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:41.860
While shooting this scene Mark Hamill held his breath so long he burst a blood vessel on the side of his face. 

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:45.350
Many of the Tatooine sets are still standing today in the Tunisian desert.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:49.110
Denis Lawson who played Wedge Antilles is Ewan McGregor's uncle. 

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.330
The blockade runner was the original design for the Millennium Falcon.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.540
The Jawa language is based on a sped up version of the Zulu language. 

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.570
Greedo speaks a South American language called Quechua.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.790
Yoda's species is never named in the movies.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.470
The word Ewok is never said out loud in any of the films. 

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:09.770
The original design of Yoda was a monkey carrying a cane and wearing a mask. 

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:13.260
The bounty hunter droid IG-88 was built from recycled film props. 

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.940
His head is a drink dispenser from the Mos Eisley Cantina.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:22.110
In an early draft of Jedi, Obi Wan and Yoda returned to their physical bodies to either assist Luke in his final battle with the emperor

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.530
Or join him during the celebration on Endor. 

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:27.210
No physical clone trooper outfits were ever produced. 

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:30.160
Every clone trooper scene in the prequels is CGI. 

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.920
Qui-Gon's communicator is an altered Gillette Sensor Excel women's razor. 

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.750
According to Samuel L. Jackson the words "bad mother f***er" are engraved on the hilt of his lightsaber. 

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.230
During fight scenes an excited Ewan McGegor kept making lightsaber sounds. 

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:47.070
Ahmed Best who played Jar Jar Binks can be seen out of character in the background of this scene. 

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.290
Along with Anthony Daniels who plays C-3P0.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.240
The Galactic Empire symbol is hidden in this shot of Anakin.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:58.340
Anakin Skywalker meets six of the nine diagnostic criteria for borderline personality disorder. 

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.430
In an early draft of episode IV, RD-D2 speaks standard english and is actually kind of a jerk. 

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:07.460
The phrase "I have a bad feeling about this" is said at least once in every film. 

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.340
I have a bad feeling about this. 

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:13.360
An Island called Niue minted and accepts Star Wars coins as currency. 

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.780
8 different people have played Darth Vader. 

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:16.810
David Prowse

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:17.660
James Earl Jones

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:18.730
Bob Anderson

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:19.800
Sebastian Shaw

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:20.880
Jake Lloyd

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.680
Hayden Christensen 

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.480
Matt Lanter

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.830
and Matt Lucas 

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:28.660
And finally a disco version of the Star Wars theme became a number one hit in 1977.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.340
How many facts did you already know? 

